==Battleground==
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Box Witch and Minions]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

